Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.13,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,Aap notice karte honge ki bahut sare log bahut under confident hote hain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:06.36,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,unko confidence nahi hota hai apne andar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:10.36,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,lekin aap pattern notice karoge un logo ka jo bahut jyada confidence hota hai jinke andar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:11.52,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,to dekho basically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.15,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,jinke andar bhi confidence hota hai na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:20.25,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,wo apne vision ko lekar ke unko thoughts jo hoti hain bahut clarity hota hai unke mind me apne thoughts ko lekar ke
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.83,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,koi if but nahi hota hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:27.64,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,to jitni jyada clarity apne aap ko apne vision ko lekar ke hoga jitne jyada aapke thoughts clear honge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:32.53,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,utni hi jyada siddhat se aap apni chijo ko execute karoge aur aap jab chijo ko execute karne lag jate ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:35.88,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,to self doubt aur fear apne aap side ho jata hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:39.81,ClassicCinema,,0,0,0,,aur yahi se aapko confidence milta hai yahi se aap confidence gain karte ho life me